{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "field-guide", "elements": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 30, "width": 708, "height": 30, "text": "A Retried Request Becomes a Safe No-Op", "originalText": "A Retried Request Becomes a Safe No-Op", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 7205}, {"id": "subtitle", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 68, "width": 1053, "height": 20, "text": "The dedupe check runs BEFORE the increment, so a timeout-triggered retry can't double-count points", "originalText": "The dedupe check runs BEFORE the increment, so a timeout-triggered retry can't double-count points", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#5c6470", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 60920}, {"id": "req1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 150, "width": 280, "height": 90, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 20855, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "req1_t", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 168, "width": 244, "height": 20, "text": "Request #1 (original)", "originalText": "Request #1 (original)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1a5c2e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 10863}, {"id": "req1_t2", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 196, "width": 258, "height": 18, "text": "match_id=771, user=42, +50", "originalText": "match_id=771, user=42, +50", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1a5c2e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 25262}, {"id": "req1_t3", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 216, "width": 288, "height": 17, "text": "(times out client-side, retried)", "originalText": "(times out client-side, retried)", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1a5c2e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 32796}, {"id": "req2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 280, "width": 280, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#e0a930", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 59431, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "req2_t", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 296, "width": 213, "height": 20, "text": "Request #2 (retry)", "originalText": "Request #2 (retry)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#7a5c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 19451}, {"id": "req2_t2", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 320, "width": 258, "height": 18, "text": "match_id=771, user=42, +50", "originalText": "match_id=771, user=42, +50", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#7a5c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 40620}, {"id": "dedupe", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 200, "width": 300, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 23100, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "dedupe_t", "type": "text", "x": 436, "y": 216, "width": 159, "height": 21, "text": "Dedupe Store", "originalText": "Dedupe Store", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 72063}, {"id": "dedupe_t2", "type": "text", "x": 436, "y": 246, "width": 131, "height": 19, "text": "key: 771:42", "originalText": "key: 771:42", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 57972}, {"id": "dedupe_t3", "type": "text", "x": 436, "y": 268, "width": 249, "height": 18, "text": "setIfAbsent(key, ttl=24h)", "originalText": "setIfAbsent(key, ttl=24h)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 76314}, {"id": "dedupe_t4", "type": "text", "x": 436, "y": 288, "width": 267, "height": 18, "text": "-> True (1st) / False (2nd)", "originalText": "-> True (1st) / False (2nd)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 85593}, {"id": "a_req1_dedupe", "type": "arrow", "x": 320, "y": 195, "width": 100, "height": 25, "points": [[0, 0], [100, 25]], "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 27750, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "triangle"}, {"id": "a_req2_dedupe", "type": "arrow", "x": 320, "y": 310, "width": 100, "height": 75, "points": [[0, 0], [100, -75]], "strokeColor": "#e0a930", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 62868, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "triangle"}, {"id": "applied", "type": "rectangle", "x": 800, "y": 150, "width": 280, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 59021, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "applied_t", "type": "text", "x": 816, "y": 168, "width": 213, "height": 20, "text": "setIfAbsent = True", "originalText": "setIfAbsent = True", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1a5c2e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 81832}, {"id": "applied_t2", "type": "text", "x": 816, "y": 196, "width": 231, "height": 18, "text": "-> ZINCRBY applied, +50", "originalText": "-> ZINCRBY applied, +50", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1a5c2e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 80414}, {"id": "skipped", "type": "rectangle", "x": 800, "y": 290, "width": 280, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#c2255c", "backgroundColor": "#ffe0eb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 8693, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "skipped_t", "type": "text", "x": 816, "y": 308, "width": 223, "height": 20, "text": "setIfAbsent = False", "originalText": "setIfAbsent = False", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#8a1a45", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 99194}, {"id": "skipped_t2", "type": "text", "x": 816, "y": 336, "width": 285, "height": 18, "text": "-> no-op, return current rank", "originalText": "-> no-op, return current rank", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#8a1a45", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 78713}, {"id": "a_dedupe_applied", "type": "arrow", "x": 720, "y": 235, "width": 80, "height": 55, "points": [[0, 0], [80, -55]], "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 95349, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "triangle"}, {"id": "a_dedupe_skipped", "type": "arrow", "x": 720, "y": 275, "width": 80, "height": 45, "points": [[0, 0], [80, 45]], "strokeColor": "#c2255c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 72022, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "triangle"}, {"id": "evidence_box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 420, "width": 1513, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#0d1117", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "seed": 32461, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "evidence_l0", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 436, "width": 1431, "height": 20, "text": "Both requests carry the SAME idempotency key (match_id:user_id) because they represent the same logical event, not two different ones.", "originalText": "Both requests carry the SAME idempotency key (match_id:user_id) because they represent the same logical event, not two different ones.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#7ee787", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 43206}, {"id": "evidence_l1", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 464, "width": 1473, "height": 20, "text": "The dedupe store's setIfAbsent is itself atomic -- there's no window where both requests could see \"absent\" and both proceed to increment.", "originalText": "The dedupe store's setIfAbsent is itself atomic -- there's no window where both requests could see \"absent\" and both proceed to increment.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#7ee787", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 4334}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}}